  "description": "Object-mapping and persistence layer for WA.FM: loads and saves form, table, view, chart, and workflow definitions to disk and SQL Server, with SQL generation and data conversion utilities. PostgreSQL support added (Npgsql provider) alongside SQL Server.",
  "id": "SI.WA.FM.OM",
