  "published": "2026-10-06T12:15:06.063Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.1: tooltip-text-align support -- GetUiCell resolves Cell.TooltipTextAlign from the form cell, falling back to the table field (values normalized to left / center / right, anything else ignored); form settings are written back with tooltip-text-align. Requires SI.WA.FM and SI.WA.Models 2.0.1. 3.0.0 (BREAKING, major release for nuget.org): PostgreSQL support added across WA.Core -- the same config XML / SQL now runs on SQL Server or PostgreSQL (Npgsql). All SI.WA.* packages moved to a new major version together; reference them with matching versions. SQL generation is now dialect-aware (SqlDialect) for SQL Server and PostgreSQL; APIs take a DataBridge instead of the removed EF DbRepository.",
